">over</span><span begin="03:47.940" end="03:50.250">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:50.250" end="03:55.830"><span begin="03:50.250" end="03:52.890">Loneliness </span><span begin="03:52.890" end="03:53.220">be </span><span begin="03:53.220" end="03:55.830">over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.940" end="04:18.060"><span begin="03:56.940" end="03:57.810">When </span><span begin="03:57.810" end="03:58.140">will </span><span begin="03:58.140" end="03:58.290">this </span><span begin="03:58.290" end="04:00.570">loneliness </span><span begin="04:00.570" end="04:00.900">be </span><span begin="04:00.900" end="04:03.240">over</span><span begin="04:03.240" end="04:18.060">?</span></p></div></body></tt>